WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:18.140
Kanemayu akufotokoza mmene mungakonzekerere mwana ndi mayi kapena womulera musanayese mayeso a fundal red reflex mwa ana obadwa kumene komanso ana okulirapo.

2
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:29.140
Mwanayo ayenera kusungidwa motetezeka koma momasuka, kaya pamphumi, paphewa, kapena, ngati khanda, atagona chagada.

3
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:37.120
Ndikofunika kuti azidzimva kukhala otetezeka. Ana ang'onoang'ono amatha kukhala osakhazikika ndipo angafunike kuwakuta.

4
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.180
Kuwunika atangomaliza kudyetsa kungathandize popeza adzakhala omasuka komanso ogona pang'ono.

5
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:49.220
Ana okulirapo angakhazikike mwa kusewera ndi chidole kwakanthawi kochepa.

6
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:55.320
Lankhulani ndi kamvekedwe kaubwenzi ndikuyesera kufika pamlingo wamaso awo.

7
00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:00.500
Fotokozani zomwe mukuchita ndikupeza chilolezo musanayambe.

8
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:10.440
Choyamba, funsani mayi kapena wosamalira ngati awona cholakwika chilichonse ndi diso kapena masomphenya a mwana wawo komanso kuti azindikira nthawi yayitali bwanji vutolo.

9
00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:15.120
Kenako, yang’anani nkhope ndi maso a mwanayo. Dzifunseni mafunso ena.

10
00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:24.300
Kodi mwanayo akuwoneka kuti akupweteka diso limodzi kapena onse awiri? Kodi maso otseguka kapena akutseka mwamphamvu?

11
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:31.280
Kodi pali kuthirira kapena kutuluka m'maso? Kodi maso ndi ofanana kukula? Kodi zikope zatupa?

12
00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:38.580
Tsopano taganizirani mmene mwanayo akuonekera. Sungani nkhope yanu pang'onopang'ono kuchokera mbali ndi mbali, kuyang'ana maso awo.

13
00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:47.970
Muzimwetulira mwakachetechete. Kodi mwanayo amatsatira kayendedwe ka nkhope yanu kapena amayankha kumwetulira kwanu mwakachetechete?

14
00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:53.990
Apanso, dzifunseni mafunso. Kodi maso onse amayenda momasuka komanso limodzi?

15
00:01:54.430 --> 00:02:01.110
Kodi maso owongoka kapena diso limodzi likutembenukira mkati kapena kunja? Kodi maso amagwedera?

16
00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:12.200
Mukhozanso kugwiritsa ntchito magetsi pa Arclight ndi zolinga zazithunzi kuti mukhale ndi chidwi ndikuwunika mawonekedwe a masomphenya.

17
00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:20.660
Sunthani chandamalecho kumbali, mmwamba ndi pansi. Yang'anani kuti muwone ngati mwanayo akukonzekera ndikutsatira chandamale.

18
00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:26.600
Kodi angafikire ndi kuloza molondola pa chandamalecho?

19
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:35.060
Nthawi zambiri, diso limodzi lokha silingathe kuona bwino. Inu kapena mayi mukhoza kuphimba diso limodzi, kenako linalo.

20
00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:43.320
Sunthani chandamalecho ndikuyerekeza momwe mwanayo amachitira akamagwiritsa ntchito maso onse awiri, ndiyeno imodzi panthawi.

21
00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:51.380
Ngati mwanayo sakonda kuphimba diso limodzi, ndiye kuti diso losaphimbidwa silikuwona bwino.

22
00:02:51.560 --> 00:03:00.560
Ngati mukuganiza kuti mutha kuwona cholakwika ndi diso lakunja, yang'anani mosamala kwambiri pogwiritsa ntchito kumapeto kwa Arclight.

23
00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:12.150
Yatsani magetsi ndikuyandikira pafupi ndi 6 cm. Mungafunike kugwiritsa ntchito chala chanu kuti mutsegule zikope modekha.

24
00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:24.070
Dzifunseni mafunso ena. Kodi mbali yoyera ya diso ndi pinki kapena yofiira? Kodi wophunzira kapena cornea imvi kapena woyera?

25
00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:35.160
Kodi wophunzira akuzungulira? Kodi mukuwona matupi achilendo? Tsopano mwakonzeka kuyesa mayeso a reflex.
